{"id":"n60409-1-10","stage":1,"title":"비누 · 肥皂","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60409-1-10-1","ko":"엄마, 손 씻고 왔으니까 밥 주세요.","zh":"妈妈，我已经洗过手了，可以给我饭吃吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"손","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}},{"text":"씻고","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씻고","audio":"/audio/306c2e1e6609bdca733c.mp3"}},{"text":"왔으니까","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔으니까","audio":"/audio/3db84649590bdf58de74.mp3"}},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21b36a8a4cf7a7a92664.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60409-1-10-2","ko":"대충 물만 묻히지 말고 비누로 깨끗이 닦아야지.","zh":"别只是随便冲一下水，要用肥皂彻底洗干净。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대충","meaning":"粗略，大略","explanation":"대충：粗略，大略","readings":[{"term":"대충","audio":"/audio/dccccc5cc19b6b212129.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14358","senseId":"2","lemma":"대충","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대충","audio":"/audio/dccccc5cc19b6b212129.mp3"}},{"text":"물만","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물만","audio":"/audio/67e013f532580b181b05.mp3"}},{"text":"묻히지","meaning":"沾上，染上","explanation":"묻히다：沾上，染上；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15725","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻히지","audio":"/audio/d5a8bbbf8a1c578cea14.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"비누로","meaning":"肥皂，香皂","explanation":"비누：肥皂，香皂；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"비누","audio":"/audio/39705b0cb286692b21db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60409","senseId":"1","lemma":"비누","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비누로","audio":"/audio/7335b6671d64bea5496a.mp3"}},{"text":"깨끗이","meaning":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","explanation":"깨끗이：完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","readings":[{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61076","senseId":"5","lemma":"깨끗이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}},{"text":"닦아야지.","meaning":"刷，擦","explanation":"닦다：刷，擦；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"닦다","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60316","senseId":"2","lemma":"닦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닦아야지","audio":"/audio/54505d847fcf5c63a513.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dccccc5cc19b6b21","term":"대충","zh":"粗略，大略","audio":"/audio/dccccc5cc19b6b212129.mp3","entryId":"14358","definition":"筛选最基本的程度。","pronunciation":["대충"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"28120c6c18d8503b","term":"묻히다","zh":"沾上，染上","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3","entryId":"15725","definition":"将液体或粉末等附在其它物体上，使其留下痕迹。","pronunciation":["무치다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"39705b0cb286692b","term":"비누","zh":"肥皂，香皂","audio":"/audio/39705b0cb286692b21db.mp3","entryId":"60409","definition":"沾上水打出泡沫后用来清洗衣物或身上所粘污渍的东西。","pronunciation":["비누"]},{"id":"356f24a2b3817821","term":"깨끗이","zh":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3","entryId":"61076","definition":"毫无留痕地。","pronunciation":["깨끄시"]},{"id":"ba0c254ce311d46f","term":"닦다","zh":"刷，擦","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3","entryId":"60316","definition":"干净地洗去。","pronunciation":["닥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/334d818582a3a1124b4d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60409","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.6503,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别只是随便冲一下水，要用肥皂彻底洗干净。","我们的互助会什么时候聚会来着？","妈妈，我已经洗过手了，可以给我饭吃吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别只是随便冲一下水，要用肥皂彻底洗干净。","妈妈，我已经洗过手了，可以给我饭吃吗？","我们的互助会什么时候聚会来着？"],"answer":0}]}
